経験とか知識とかもあるかもですが、じゃあそれが差し出した時間に見合うものかってのは常に意識しといたほうが良いかとおもいます。\n\nというのが一経営者の老婆心w","ts":"1630683030.059000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mcwB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd49ef1d-056b-40fa-b994-35ba25546d68","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"経営者として言わせてもらうと、会社ってのはある意味で従業員の時間をお金に換えて、上前ハネてる搾取構造なんですよ。それはSOもってても役員でもない限り一緒。\n\nもっとも従業員は個人ではなかなか自分の時間をお金に換えられないんですけども。","ts":"1630682791.057000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vZeRT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bea1f224-98d0-4414-8e89-ca35a595e865","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"今のところSOもない中途社員ですわ。","ts":"1630682731.056000","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1630682752.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6wi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e45d265-8436-4424-a827-0d165f820d04","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"創業メンバーで成功すればするほどお財布に跳ね返ってくるってんならまだなぁ・・・","ts":"1630682672.054400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YSx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8172c733-206d-46a5-8530-0498975ea534","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"マネージャーやりたくないけど人増えたし誰かがやらねば、と言ってました。","ts":"1630682594.053700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VsKWd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f3706a2-f3a6-40e6-bae9-c562dea5abec","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"とはいえスタートアップを言い訳にもして欲しくないですねw\n2人の内一方はこの半年でしぶしぶマネージャーになった感じです。","ts":"1630682480.052200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QH6Ux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b47043e-81d9-47e3-a74d-b821cc104fdc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"大きな会社だとだいたい昇格時点でそういうことを教育・研修してるんですよね。","ts":"1630682362.050900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+ylv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dc18272-192c-49a6-8962-cefd834a9fc0","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"いわゆるマネジメントがマネジメントの勉強をしてない問題だ（一定以上昇格すると、なぜか急にマネジメントになる問題","ts":"1630682329.050300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"voUhe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5abdc0d3-826c-4b03-bef6-d41d96a2937d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"上司になっている人にそういう教育が行き届いてない時点でリスクが顕在化してますよ。","ts":"1630682233.049000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U782D5DF1","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=fYqv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd5d37ea-7ec6-441a-bbbb-5057f0b34381","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"上司のスタンドプレーじゃなくて会社の方針がこれならアウトっちゃアウトか","ts":"1630682194.047900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tRj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"313303d5-113a-41fb-8484-7387b87f43e0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはフェアネスを自ら投げ捨ててまでやる価値があるか、という視点もありますよ。っていうかそういうフェアネスを会社側が放棄するようなら、ほかの問題も起こしかねないというリスクマネジメントになる。","ts":"1630682141.047000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1630682159.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zre"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0a8f7f1-2342-4c52-922f-fb7ad4f8e959","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"はい。マイナス査定さえ避けられればガン無視でいいなと思います。","ts":"1630682104.046400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LNC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2aeb3ead-f07d-4854-9cab-c0a3613f893b","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"文書にもしてないならガン無視して仕事でいいかもなぁ","ts":"1630682033.044400","team":"T03C